name: Lucky Card — money trigger
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: a Lucky Card triggers its $20 money payout. Tight Ante 1 event: find a Lucky Card
  that successfully pays out.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - luckyMoney: [1]
should:
  - joker: LuckyCat
    score: 45
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    score: 40
  - joker: EightBall
    score: 25
